# NavierStokes-PINN / capstone-pinn-cfd
# Tracked by default: README, requirements.txt, Utilities/plotting.py,
# main/continuous_time_identification (Navier-Stokes)/NavierStokes.ipynb
# Large CFD exports live under main/Data/ and stay local unless you opt in (see bottom).

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.Python
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
.env
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
dist/
build/

# --- Jupyter ---
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- OS / editors ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# --- PINN / notebook generated outputs ---
main/continuous_time_identification (Navier-Stokes)/figures/
*.npz

# --- CFD / Fluent / ANSYS-style data (large, regenerable) ---
main/Data/

# Optional: if you add small benchmark .mat files under main/Data/ again, track them with
# un-ignore rules *after* the main/Data/ line, e.g.:
# !main/Data/cylinder_nektar_wake.mat
# !main/Data/cylinder_nektar_t0_vorticity.mat
